// Survival: recipes unlock by touch. A recipe appears the first time any of its inputs reaches the pack
// (picked up off the floor, dug, crafted, given). Before that it isn't listed at all. The Survival kit
// (a pickaxe, wood, torches, grubs, roots, fungus oil) shows the wooden recipes; clay and copper ore come later.
map
##############################################
#............................................#
#............................................#
#............................................#
#............................................#
#.....@......................................#
##############################################
end
mode survival
expect 2 recipe:Pickaxe == 1          // the kit's wood shows it
expect 2 recipe:Brick_x4 == 0
expect 2 recipe:Copper_ingot == 0
expect 2 known:Clay == 0
// a lump of clay lying ahead: walking over it picks it up
drop 3 Clay 4 -1
hold 4-40 right
expect 41 inv:Clay == 1
expect 41 known:Clay == 1
expect 41 recipe:Brick_x4 == 1         // touching clay shows what clay makes
expect 41 recipe:Copper_ingot == 0     // still unseen
drop 42 CopperOre 12 -1
hold 43-80 right
expect 81 known:CopperOre == 1
expect 81 recipe:Copper_ingot == 1
expect 81 recipe:Bore == 0             // iron and crystal: not yet
// Creative lists everything
switch 82 creative
expect 83 recipe:Drill == 1
expect 83 recipe:Bore == 1
